{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-75393", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-75393", "text": "'iOS cannot do this. A Shortcuts personal '\n'automation can only trigger on Apple’s '\n'own fixed list of events, and no app can '\n'add one — so nothing here can start a '\n'shortcut for you. Android gets it; this '\n'is a platform limit, not a setting.'", "sha256": "6cbf47fdfb2dd21aa69e44f0e06533d6b7e4c46797641242c87fd34d7a2e56f0", "kind": "dart", "start": 75393, "end": 75844, "line": 1742}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-76469", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-76469", "text": "'Extras: records (int), at (unix seconds)'", "sha256": "d4495ad19a3148e61a889694233fd72da28fd8f9189a05677c05979bd543d003", "kind": "dart", "start": 76469, "end": 76511, "line": 1759}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-76807", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-76807", "text": "'What it will never send'", "sha256": "12730eaa1be8164c2038ebbcc7157d524e8e6d4d603b1b2c3323aedafe9a2ec8", "kind": "dart", "start": 76807, "end": 76832, "line": 1767}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-76970", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-76970", "text": "'No readiness, no strain, no sleep score — on either '\n'platform. A number this app would have shown as absent, '\n'with a reason attached, becomes a bare zero the moment '\n'it leaves. Facts about the sync go out; measurements do '\n'not.'", "sha256": "ef1b2e9b2fe317bedb71ce72eace8b7cf6dc0ff7be1105a06fb5ebc317c2e992", "kind": "dart", "start": 76970, "end": 77327, "line": 1771}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-77583", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-77583", "text": "'Buzzing the band from a shortcut'", "sha256": "9e7c94113e8ee10dde57fd7a7352b0c49c2e405e5c1f12e3e84ae4830e47f10e", "kind": "dart", "start": 77583, "end": 77617, "line": 1783}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-77968", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-77968", "text": "'Send '\n'wtf.openstrap.openstrap_edge.BUZZ_STRAP '\n'with this token as the “token” string '\n'extra. Without it any app on the phone '\n'could buzz your band.'", "sha256": "7d0af7ebf3487ffe54dec74f6f2b0c06739cf804d717f516f5bf6fd45735ca24", "kind": "dart", "start": 77968, "end": 78285, "line": 1791}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-78396", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-78396", "text": "'This direction works on iOS: a shortcut you '\n'run yourself can reach the app. What it '\n'cannot do is run itself when the band '\n'syncs.'", "sha256": "2fd84fa23fa2f11fb26b87f9f308f375d0e4bef18a7f3cc9d35a34fb6770ecef", "kind": "dart", "start": 78396, "end": 78655, "line": 1797}
{"id": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart:offset-79049", "file": "lib/ui2/profile/settings.dart", "location": "offset-79049", "text": "'No token yet — reopen this screen.'", "sha256": "1cf621920fce769d97b39b8f4f21e1e8066c47498b7f5d480e83dd08a9ca0e06", "kind": "dart", "start": 79049, "end": 79085, "line": 1808}
