{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart:offset-3201", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart", "location": "offset-3201", "text": "'No model is set up'", "sha256": "e4c46ef890ac45c6ac68875f4fb92810a38df46939e9356f0d1d8bd8218beb4c", "kind": "dart", "start": 3201, "end": 3221, "line": 100}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart:offset-3299", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart", "location": "offset-3299", "text": "'A briefing is written by a model you choose. Until you '\n'pick one there is nothing to generate and nothing '\n'has been sent anywhere.'", "sha256": "6d44167214de0411e20ae820c18f4e05fcdbc54bf65b763807ab7163b10e2081", "kind": "dart", "start": 3299, "end": 3495, "line": 102}
