{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart:offset-9137", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart", "location": "offset-9137", "text": "'Nothing. There was no request — the note above was '\n'written on this phone.'", "sha256": "9b0e4482e6199f21820c5d08f6c23789c871345e4d404b49c0c5e2513885c25b", "kind": "dart", "start": 9137, "end": 9247, "line": 249}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart:offset-9376", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart", "location": "offset-9376", "text": "'These numbers went to $host, on this machine. '\n'Nothing left it.'", "sha256": "f11222d19dd3e912a655fc4d365e3ea7fb9c8692244963fdd6fc753b44e8713e", "kind": "dart", "start": 9376, "end": 9479, "line": 253}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart:offset-9590", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart", "location": "offset-9590", "text": "'These numbers, and nothing else, were sent to '\n'$host as ${config.model}. No raw '\n'recordings, no name, no identifier.'", "sha256": "840606ac378bbc8d88d6b6225e42fc2a4d99610791ccb298fde5fc69fdf34195", "kind": "dart", "start": 9590, "end": 9784, "line": 256}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart:offset-10070", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart", "location": "offset-10070", "text": "'Nothing stood out, so nothing was asked'", "sha256": "a5c14ba265140b1703ccaefbfc1a53c47d4534a35bb12eb2e36bcec2f7feb818", "kind": "dart", "start": 10070, "end": 10111, "line": 268}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart:offset-10174", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart", "location": "offset-10174", "text": "'The sweep runs on this phone. It only calls a model when it has '\n'a finding to hand it, and today it had none.'", "sha256": "3d8b5c209c6d962fc403b8c084113cf4d4f9755cadfbc52d175cb6403495b671", "kind": "dart", "start": 10174, "end": 10309, "line": 270}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart:offset-10472", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/ai_briefing.dart", "location": "offset-10472", "text": "'Nothing was available to send'", "sha256": "70dd640895a0b677e9ee05cda67fe787c9566f9eb40fbd36bb2aa5f7b56ca56c", "kind": "dart", "start": 10472, "end": 10503, "line": 276}
