{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/beats.dart:offset-25570", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/beats.dart", "location": "offset-25570", "text": "'No day in this window was screened'", "sha256": "5fef7c3082ebed15ecc609cbd134130c7a1a31b48dcfee7bbcf440060c3e947f", "kind": "dart", "start": 25570, "end": 25606, "line": 603}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/beats.dart:offset-25877", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/beats.dart", "location": "offset-25877", "text": "'A screen, not a test.\\n\\n'\n'A day the screen did not fire is not a day you were '\n'cleared — it cannot rule anything out, and it never '\n'could. Outlined days were not screened at all: too few '\n'clean beats, or too much movement.\\n\\n'", "sha256": "a1ba7483697fb9c461abe17d2961e4ac932e4c566c8a248aa78b7f1530e8d42e", "kind": "dart", "start": 25877, "end": 26193, "line": 612}
{"id": "lib/ui2/screens/beats.dart:offset-26735", "file": "lib/ui2/screens/beats.dart", "location": "offset-26735", "text": "'Wrist pulse is not an ECG. If symptoms are what brought '\n'you here, a clinician can test that properly.'", "sha256": "e04e4b462702d67cddcbbc97da05188143217222e39aad06276c18459dd4801e", "kind": "dart", "start": 26735, "end": 26861, "line": 624}
